From: burakgon <burakgon12@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] quirks: add PixArt 093A:4F05 haptic touchpad (ASUS ExpertBook Ultra B9406CAA)

The haptic touchpad in the ASUS ExpertBook Ultra B9406CAA
(ASCP1D80:00 093A:4F05) is a pressure pad like 093A:4811. Its report
descriptor gives Tip Pressure no Logical Maximum of its own, so it inherits
the Y field's 2601, real presses sit far below that, and libinput discards
every motion as "kernel bug: Touch jump detected and discarded". The kernel
sets INPUT_PROP_PRESSUREPAD only for pads that report Button Type 1, which
this one does not.

Mark it as a pressure pad, as for 093A:4811.

---
 quirks/30-vendor-pixart.quirks | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/quirks/30-vendor-pixart.quirks b/quirks/30-vendor-pixart.quirks
index c38188c..b57c990 100644
--- a/quirks/30-vendor-pixart.quirks
+++ b/quirks/30-vendor-pixart.quirks
@@ -36,6 +36,15 @@ MatchProduct=0x4811
 MatchUdevType=touchpad
 AttrInputProp=+INPUT_PROP_PRESSUREPAD
 
+# "093A:4F05 Touchpad": haptic pressure touchpad in the ASUS ExpertBook Ultra B9406CAA.
+# ASCP1D80:00 093A:4F05 Touchpad
+[Pixart Haptic Touchpad (093A:4F05)]
+MatchBus=i2c
+MatchVendor=0x093A
+MatchProduct=0x4F05
+MatchUdevType=touchpad
+AttrInputProp=+INPUT_PROP_PRESSUREPAD
+
 # ASUS Chromebook CX1405CTA
 # ASUS Chromebook CX1505CKA
 [Pixart Touchpad (093A:200F)]
